  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a roasted turkey on a holiday table with a Christmas tree in the background. The text overlay reads \"see? i fuckin told you!\" and \"little foil on top keeps them jewsy.\" This juxtaposition of a festive, culturally significant meal (turkey) with a derogatory, antisemitic stereotype (\"keeps them jewsy\") is intended to mock or demean Jewish people by associating them with a specific food item. The phrase \"keeps them jewsy\" is a crude, offensive trope that implies Jewish people are somehow 'kept' or 'controlled' by the presence of foil on top of the turkey, which is a false and harmful stereotype. This meme uses visual material (the turkey) mapped onto textual material (the antisemitic phrase) to deliver a hateful message targeting Jewish people based on their religion, which falls under the category of antisemitism as defined in the provided knowledge base. The intent is to provoke, offend, and spread harmful stereotypes against Jewish individuals and communities.",
